4. Better error reporting in verbose mode
5. Handling both CalledProcessError and OSError exceptions
6. Proper stream handling with universal_newlines=True for string output
7. Maintaining the original functionality while making it more robust
8. Using communicate() to properly handle process output and avoid deadlocks

These changes make the code more reliable while maintaining its original purpose and interface.

